// This atlas is a Example for:
// -> Regular JSON format to load.
// -> "texture" is mandatory. ALWAYS ON ALL JSON
// -> Can be two options, "animations" | "tiles", both defined for make 

//! This format have animation, defined tiles size.

{
  "name": "Cat Iddle",
  "texture": "Cat_Iddle.png",
  "tileSize": 32,
  "animations":
  {
    "Iddle": {"col": 0, "row": 0, "frameCount": 8}
  }
}
